        "skip_nulls.descr": "<xdoc><p>Specifies whether null values in the grouping field or fields are skipped during selection.</p><ul><li>Checked—Skip through all the null values in the grouping fields during selection.</li><li>Unchecked—Set as default. Include all the null values in the grouping fields during selection. This is the default.</li></ul></xdoc>",
